 Captain America  who kind of bring the Avengers team  together and I think we'll see this in  shangchi and the legend of the ten Rings  because the release date is before the  King Dynasty and Secret Wars now right  now rumor has it that Marvel Studios is  eyeing a February 14 2025 release date  for Shang Chi 2. this was reported on by  the direct and Charles Murphy of  Murphy's mom diverse seem to back this  up as well online a shangshi and the  legend of the tin Rings director Dustin  Daniel [ __ ] has recently been  confirmed to be directing Avengers the  King Dynasty so this kind of connects  here if you connect the dots this makes  sense the King Dynasty is an Avengers  film and if the Avengers are going to  start forming and chiangchi is going to  be a big Avenger and his movie is coming  right before the King Dynasty it would  make sense for Dustin Daniel [ __ ] to  return to direct shanxi too because it  leads right into his next movie the King  Dynasty like leading right into it  shangshi would be in February and then  the King Dynasty would be May 2nd of  2025. now there has actually been a  little bit of a debate recently on  whether or not Dustin Daniel [ __ ]  would return to Direct shangchi One  because he is also producing the Wonder  Man series that Marvel Studios is about  to release as well so many fans think  that because he is going to be directing  Avengers the King Dynasty and going to  be producing wonder man that he won't  actually have have time to direct Shang  Chi too however Charles Murphy of  Murphy's Multiverse stated he's  absolutely directing shangchi too I  don't know why people keep thinking that  producing Wonder Man would take  precedence over Shang Chi 2 producing  doesn't mean he's necessarily doing much  of anything and that can be true for  producing sometimes not a ton of time is  required when you're producing a film  especially if there are many producers  attached to it and over a year ago when  shangshi came out I actually interviewed  Dustin Daniel [ __ ] and he was excited  to return to do a sequel so I would be  shocked if he didn't return to direct  Shang Chi too and I think he did such an  amazing job on the very first shangchi  and the legend of the ten Rings film  that Marvel Studios definitely wants him  to return as well but as of right now it  looks like we tentatively have release  dates for Deadpool 3 and Chung Chi 2.  and these are two movies that I am just  super super excited for and I hope you  all are too but let me know all of your  thoughts in the comments down below  don't forget to like the video and  subscribe to stay up to date on on the  latest MCU news for live updates you can  follow me on Instagram and Twitter and  as always thank you all so much for  watching woof woof
 

